(text "Supply: the PIO 3.3 V rail (pins 17/51, 3.3 V nominal, up to 3.5 V) feeds every FX3 I/O domain\ndirectly (VIO1-5 and CVDDQ, 1.7-3.6 V operating). TLV62569 buck makes the 1.2 V core and USB 3\nsupplies from it (SLVSDG0: VFB 0.6 V, R1 = R2 = 100k, 6.8 pF feed-forward for R2 = 100k, 2.2 uH, 4.7\nuF in minimum, 10-47 uF out). EN tied high: the core runs whenever the console is on." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cf4d89e1-542f-42f4-825c-c3cb353b5d29"))
